T16:52:30Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThis PR is a continuation on the plane tracking logic introduced not long ago. It properly checks whether the supplied buffer id's change. If they remain the same from discovery to discovery this means the mesh data remains unchanged and allows us to skip retrieving the mesh data and comparing it to the previous data.\r\n\r\nThis should result in a decent performance upgrade.\r\n\r\nIt also adds start/stop functions for the built-in plane tracking feature. This allows us to react properly when permissions have not been provided from the start. Making full use of this will require additional logic in the vendor plugin as each XR platform has different permission requirements.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis logic can be tested with the following demo project:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/pull/1338\r\n\r\nThis PR is dependent on #121123\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121488/reactions","total_count"